<title>FINLAND: MERITA TO SELL SAS RADISSON HOTEL TO SOK.</title>
<headline>MERITA TO SELL SAS RADISSON HOTEL TO SOK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish banking group Merita Oy said on Thursday it had signed a letter of intent to sell its Radisson SAS hotel operation in Helsinki to the cooperative SOK hotel chain for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;Merita Real Estate Ltd has signed a letter of intent on the sale of the Radisson SAS hotel operation in Helsinki to the SOK chain,&quot; Merita said in a statement.</p>
<p>A preliminary agreement was also reached that the hotel property will be sold to an investor chosen by SOK.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
